{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/d85fdda19c644a580dd4ab0d220f8cd5.poster.avif?t=1758650108\" width=942 height=62 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/d85fdda19c644a580dd4ab0d220f8cd5.webm?t=1758650108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/d85fdda19c644a580dd4ab0d220f8cd5.mp4?t=1758650108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, you receive a message congratulating you on getting the job you have been seeking for so long. The pay is enormous, but you are warned that you will have to work at a motel called \u201cHorizon\u201d as a night administrator from 18:00 to 6:00.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your first day, you are brought to the motel office, where you learn that you must complete 21 shifts, and that the motel has mandatory \u201cRules\u201d which must be followed, no matter how strange the circumstances may seem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/69e93bf2e0578215492f20b26c027e94.poster.avif?t=1758650108\" width=942 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/69e93bf2e0578215492f20b26c027e94.webm?t=1758650108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/69e93bf2e0578215492f20b26c027e94.mp4?t=1758650108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rules must be followed regardless of how strange or absurd they may seem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You should be aware that not all rules are known, and some you will have to discover on your own\u2014sometimes at the cost of your own life. Always be cautious and pay attention to any unusual occurrences in the motel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/8ceba80da52dce020187040b529f77ac.poster.avif?t=1758650108\" width=1016 height=568 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/8ceba80da52dce020187040b529f77ac.webm?t=1758650108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/8ceba80da52dce020187040b529f77ac.mp4?t=1758650108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if something goes wrong\u2026 in any case, the company will hire another night administrator who will definitely know the new rule.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/ca2db1ff3deb278275e8f3e75af1520f.poster.avif?t=1758650108\" width=942 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/ca2db1ff3deb278275e8f3e75af1520f.webm?t=1758650108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/ca2db1ff3deb278275e8f3e75af1520f.mp4?t=1758650108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean the rooms, take out the trash, and maintain order and cleanliness. Fulfill the requests and demands of the guests\u2014make sure all guests are satisfied.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/57fc58e8269a1c74ebffa51f87e27c2a.poster.avif?t=1758650108\" width=1016 height=568 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/57fc58e8269a1c74ebffa51f87e27c2a.webm?t=1758650108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/57fc58e8269a1c74ebffa51f87e27c2a.mp4?t=1758650108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The company will duly recognize your contribution to the motel\u2019s work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/ef969610432be7c72817a1143f8e142a.poster.avif?t=1758650108\" width=942 height=58 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/ef969610432be7c72817a1143f8e142a.webm?t=1758650108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/ef969610432be7c72817a1143f8e142a.mp4?t=1758650108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully inspect the guests and their documents, interact with them, use various devices, and monitor your surroundings\u2014all of this will help you identify those who are merely pretending to be ordinary people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/d40f4c782cf87f27147078452ab3e69f.poster.avif?t=1758650108\" width=1016 height=568 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/d40f4c782cf87f27147078452ab3e69f.webm?t=1758650108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/d40f4c782cf87f27147078452ab3e69f.mp4?t=1758650108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure of everything. Is this an ordinary person? Is nothing unusual happening? Should you check them into the motel? Or should you refuse this guest?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/0a172ef11460a286087849e65627dc0f.poster.avif?t=1758650108\" width=942 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/0a172ef11460a286087849e65627dc0f.webm?t=1758650108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/0a172ef11460a286087849e65627dc0f.mp4?t=1758650108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The company\u2019s merchant is ready to assist you, but for a certain fee. Upgrade your existing equipment, buy new items - the better your gear, the easier it will be to survive the next shift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But remember - not all purchases may be useful, and some\u2026 may even alter existence itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/ac3b169ca184e71890b7e1f87258579a.poster.avif?t=1758650108\" width=942 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/ac3b169ca184e71890b7e1f87258579a.webm?t=1758650108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/ac3b169ca184e71890b7e1f87258579a.mp4?t=1758650108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Cult and the Church are interested in the motel; however, they are neither your allies nor your enemies. Be cautious with them, as improving the favor of one may worsen the favor of the other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/627acabfc900634a07ace065e464c009.poster.avif?t=1758650108\" width=1016 height=568 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/627acabfc900634a07ace065e464c009.webm?t=1758650108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/627acabfc900634a07ace065e464c009.mp4?t=1758650108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can maintain balance, or you can\u2026 in any case, the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/2f9ec867e04e84bea1c15053bac708d5.poster.avif?t=1758650108\" width=942 height=62 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/2f9ec867e04e84bea1c15053bac708d5.webm?t=1758650108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/2f9ec867e04e84bea1c15053bac708d5.mp4?t=1758650108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3156680?t=1758650108","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/8025fd6d014f7feb550e49264a19907d436ce0b3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758650108","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/84edadb79eeb072b2656714bdcec10db001c28fe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758650108","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/84edadb79eeb072b2656714bdcec10db001c28fe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758650108","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/d85fdda19c644a580dd4ab0d220f8cd5.poster.avif?t=1758650108\" width=942 height=62 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/d85fdda19c644a580dd4ab0d220f8cd5.webm?t=1758650108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/d85fdda19c644a580dd4ab0d220f8cd5.mp4?t=1758650108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, you receive a message congratulating you on getting the job you have been seeking for so long. The pay is enormous, but you are warned that you will have to work at a motel called \u201cHorizon\u201d as a night administrator from 18:00 to 6:00.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your first day, you are brought to the motel office, where you learn that you must complete 21 shifts, and that the motel has mandatory \u201cRules\u201d which must be followed, no matter how strange the circumstances may seem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/69e93bf2e0578215492f20b26c027e94.poster.avif?t=1758650108\" width=942 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a